  bodyClass="use-header-transparent use-menu-secondary-uppercase use-menu-button-uppercase use-headings-link-plain search-panel-hide-submit-label search-panel-hide-close-label search-panel-hide-open-label use-menu-bar use-header-fixed use-header-fixed-mobile use-header-priority use-header-boxed"
  locale="sk"
  image="/files/nahled-homepage.jpg"
>
<div class="section height--low align--middle color--default section-width-boxed section-has-background"><div class="section-body"><div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-inline"><h1 class="center">Naši zákazníci<span class="text-highlight">.</span></h1>
</div></div></div></div><div class="section-background" style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"></div></div>
<div class="section height--low align--middle color--default section-width-boxed section-has-background"><div class="section-body"><div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-image no-edge-mobile block-image--light-blue mobile-order-reverse"><div class="flexcard flexcard-card flexcard-size--normal flexcard-media-right valign-middle align-left flexcard-media--stretch"><div class="flexcard-media"><div class="image-wrapper"><a class="image image-mask ratio-original" href="/sk/blog/villa-sandy-resort" style="padding-bottom:50%"><img alt="VILLA SANDY" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width:1390px) 695px, (min-width:720px) 50.00vw, 100.00vw" src="/files/r/1280/case-study-villa-sandy-resort-hdr.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/case-study-villa-sandy-resort-hdr.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/case-study-villa-sandy-resort-hdr.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/case-study-villa-sandy-resort-hdr.webp 1920w"/></a></div></div><div class="flexcard-content"><div class="flexcard-content-wrapper"><div class="text-block"><h2>VILLA SANDY<span class="text-highlight">.</span></h2>
<p class="text-large">Využitie hotelovej AI vo VILLA SANDY poskytuje automatické odpovede hosťom bez nutnosti zapojenia personálu.</p>
<p class="text-large"><strong style="font-family: var(--base-font-family); font-size: 16px;">CASE STUDY → 2 MINUTY ČTENÍ </strong></p>
</div><div class="image-btn"><a class="btn btn-default btn-sm" href="/sk/blog/villa-sandy-resort"><span aria-hidden="true" class="btn__icon"></span><span class="btn__label">PREČÍTAJTE SI CASE STUDY</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section-background" style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"></div></div>
<div class="section height--low align--middle color--default"><div class="section-body"><div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-gallery grid-sm-2"><div class="grid gallery-container" style="--gap:40px"><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Grandhotel Starý Smokovec" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-grandhotel-stary-smokovec-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Clarion Hotel" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-clarion-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Tatralandia" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-tatralandia-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Mamaison" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-mamaison-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Hotel Yasmin" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-hotel-yasmin-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo TMR Hotels" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-tmr-hotels-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Jasná" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-jasna-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Tri Studničky" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-tri-studnicky-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Vysoké Tatry" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-vysoke-tatry-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Hotel SKI" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-hotel-ski-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Hotel Perk" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-hotel-perk-michelin-key-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="CPI Hotels" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-cpi-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Resort Sobotín" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-resort-sobotin-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Aquapalace Hotel Prague" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-aguapalace-hotel-prague-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Old Town Hotels" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-old-town-hotel-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Imperial" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-imperial-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Hotel Savoy Prague" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-savoy-hotel-prague-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Hotel Perla Praha" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-hotel-perla-praha-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Buddha-Bar" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-buddha-bar-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Comfort Hotel Prague City East" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-comfort-hotel-prague-city-east-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Amarilis Hotel Prague" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-amarilis-hotel-prague-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Hotel Clement Prague" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-hotel-clement-prague-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo hotelu" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-rt-nouveau-palace-hotel-prague-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo U Salzmannů" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-u-salzmannu-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Blue Orange Resort" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-blue-orange-resort-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Chuchle Arena Praha" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-chuchle-arena-praha-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Chata Hradečanka" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-chata-hradecanka-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Café Fara" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-cafe-fara-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Vista" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-vista-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><a class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch" href="/sk/demo-zadarmo"><img alt="Vaše logo" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-vasa-2025.svg"/></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class="section height--low align--middle color--default col-gaps-bigger section-has-background"><div class="section-body"><div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-4-12"><div class="block block-quote"><div class="has-icon left block-quote-figure"><div class="block-quote-image"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square shape-circle"><img alt="Eliška Škubalová" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="auto" src="/files/r/1280/eliska-skubalova.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/eliska-skubalova.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/eliska-skubalova.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/eliska-skubalova.webp 1920w"/></div></div></div><i class="icon icon-quote-right"></i><blockquote class="block-quote-text">Protel v našom hoteli využívame už niekoľko rokov a za tú dobu nám bol vždy oporou v každodennom fungovaní hotela. Veľmi ústretová podpora je veľkým bonusom.</blockquote><div class="block-quote-author"><span class="quote-decor">–</span> Eliška Škubalová <span class="quote-decor">–</span><span class="block-quote-info">GRAND HOTEL BOHEMIA, Director of Sales</span></div></div></div></div> <div class="col col-5-12 grid-4-12"><div class="block block-quote"><div class="has-icon left block-quote-figure"><div class="block-quote-image"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square shape-circle"><img alt="Miroslav Bukva" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="auto" src="/files/r/1280/miroslav-bukva.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/miroslav-bukva.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/miroslav-bukva.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/miroslav-bukva.webp 1920w"/></div></div></div><i class="icon icon-quote-right"></i><blockquote class="block-quote-text">Výber správneho softvéru pre hotel nie je jednoduchý, pretože rôzne typy hotelov majú rôzne potreby. Pre veľký hotel s konferenčným centrom je ideálne robustné riešenie PMS PROTEL. Protel je vynikajúci z hľadiska výkonu aj ceny a dôležitou vlastnosťou je, samozrejme, veľmi dobrá podpora.</blockquote><div class="block-quote-author"><span class="quote-decor">–</span> Miroslav Bukva <span class="quote-decor">–</span><span class="block-quote-info">Aquapalace Hotel Prague, General Manager</span></div></div></div></div> <div class="col col-9-12 grid-4-12"><div class="block block-quote"><div class="has-icon left block-quote-figure"><div class="block-quote-image"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square shape-circle"><img alt="Ivona Meissner" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="auto" src="/files/r/1280/ivona-meissner.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/ivona-meissner.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/ivona-meissner.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/ivona-meissner.webp 1920w"/></div></div></div><i class="icon icon-quote-right"></i><blockquote class="block-quote-text">Ďakujem firme Protel za profesionálny support a inštaláciu!</blockquote><div class="block-quote-author"><span class="quote-decor">–</span> Ivona Meissner <span class="quote-decor">–</span><span class="block-quote-info">BWH Hotel Group, Area Director Austria &amp; Central Eastern Europe </span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section-background" style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"></div></div>
<div class="section height--low align--middle color--default col-gaps-bigger section-has-background"><div class="section-body"><div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-6-12"><div class="block block-image" id="nase-referencie"><div class="image image-mask ratio-original" style="padding-bottom:91.14583333333334%"><img alt="Marián Madara" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width:1390px) 695px, (min-width:720px) 50.00vw, 100.00vw" src="/files/r/1280/tmr-marian-madara-referencia.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/tmr-marian-madara-referencia.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/tmr-marian-madara-referencia.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/tmr-marian-madara-referencia.webp 1920w"/></div></div></div> <div class="col col-7-12 grid-6-12"><div class="block block-inline"><h2><span class="text-highlight">"</span> Podiel priameho online predaja neustále zvyšujeme aj vďaka možnostiam dynamickej cenotvorby a prepojenia s CRM, ktoré systém Protel umožňuje.</h2>
</div> <div class="block block-inline"><h2><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/marianmadara/" target="_blank">Marián Madara</a></h2>
</div> <div class="block block-inline"><p><strong>TMR Hotels</strong>, PMS Master User, Department management</p>
</div></div></div></div><div class="section-background" style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"></div></div>
<div class="section height--low align--middle color--default"><div class="section-body"><div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-divider"><hr class="divider divider--normal divider--align-left"/></div></div></div></div><div class="section-background" style="background-color:#fff"></div></div>
<div class="section height--low align--middle color--default section-has-background"><div class="section-body"><div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-image"><div class="flexcard flexcard-card flexcard-size--small flexcard-media-right valign-center align-left"><div class="flexcard-media"><div class="image-wrapper"><a class="image image-mask ratio-original" href="#kontaktny-formular" style="padding-bottom:100%"><img alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/vyhoda-hoteloveho-systemu-protel.svg"/></a></div></div><div class="flexcard-content"><div class="flexcard-content-wrapper"><div class="text-block"><h2><span class="text-highlight">" </span>Protel je celosvetovo uznávaný hotelový systém s plnou miestnou podporou. Jednoduché používanie, prehľadnosť a množstvo pokročilých funkcií z neho robia lídra na slovenskom a českom trhu!</h2>
</div><div class="image-btn"><a class="btn btn-default btn-sm" href="#kontaktny-formular"><span aria-hidden="true" class="btn__icon"></span><span class="btn__label">KONTAKTUJTE NÁS</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section-background" style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"></div></div>
